      "verifier_report": {
        "behavior_changes": [
          "Integrate the exact jkcoxson 0.1.8 upstream packet-write queue, overlapping/out-of-order ACK handling, FIN sequencing, and shared reader-close delivery.",
          "Preserve NRG zero-window persist/backoff, lost-window-update recovery, timeout diagnostics, fatal timer-flush propagation, and event-driven idle behavior.",
          "Route custom zero-window probes through the single cancellation-safe outbox; atomically dequeue application bytes with sequence and unacked bookkeeping before the first await.",
          "Retain a pending transport-flush flag across cancellation and include it in pending work until flush completes.",
          "Deliver inbound data/errors before potentially blocked outgoing flushing; do not retransmit or dequeue new data on errored connections or keep their idle timer active.",
          "Normalize the source-owned jktcp package/lock root identity to 0.1.8 without changing dependency declarations or resolved dependency entries; Cargo --locked verification is pending."
        ],
